{
  "_comment": "Exact donor dist/default/tests/law7_direct_model_route.rs::a_direct_routing_config_is_served_as_one_naming_the_planes_verb. This fresh case is the direct half; both require the same exact serialized HTTP response, preserving the donor direct==pooled byte predicate as well as full JSON equality. Only ports, temporary paths and the signing/admin credential rig are substituted. The existing blackbox runner supplies raw HTTP, whole-JSON and exact-body predicates; the call retains the donor 30-second bound.",
